    "Name": "Gatekeeper",
    "Details": "The D configuration is built around improved ATM launchers, mounting an iATM-12 in each arm with a third in the right torso. Nine tons of varied ammunition allow the Gatekeeper to take full advantage of the iATM system's versatility, while three Medium Pulse Lasers provide additional close-range firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
